    "within": "Questions 1 to 3 put parts together for 8, then 9 as 6 and 3, then 10 as 7 and 3. Question 4 is the part-whole cherry for what goes with 2 to make 8. Question 5 taps slots for what goes with 4 to make 10. Questions 6 and 7 tap four tiles to find one pair that makes 10, first 0 and 10, then 1 and 9. Question 8 taps every pair that makes 8. Question 9 taps slots for what goes with 5 to make 9. Question 10 is a short story: Sam has 5 and gets 4 more. Starts at 8.",
